{"UUID":"6e8b61d3-a08a-4f8e-aa61-0a84b6e35754","DebugName":"FoxwellEnforcement_ShipAmbush_Pyro_Hard","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_Career","MissionType":{"UUID":"62f92440-202a-43d3-9cb8-b917d4e4a102","Name":"Mercenary"},"MissionGiver":"Foxwell Enforcement","Title":"Orange Level Contract: Return the Favor","TitleKey":"Foxwell_ShipAmbush_H_title_001","Description":"Recently, a <EM4>~mission(AmbushTarget)</EM4> baited Foxwell forces with a bogus rescue beacon. By the time our forces realized what was happening, a squad of ships unleashed a devastating attack and only one Foxwell contractor survived. Their scan logs identified the bait ship, and we\u2019ve had scouts monitoring them ever since.\n\nOur surveillance has revealed the squad has a regular flight pattern that we think we can exploit. There\u2019s a sizable emission cloud at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> that makes it an ideal spot to post up. Think you have what it takes to handle this for us? \n\nIt\u2019ll be you against the <EM4>~mission(AmbushTarget)</EM4>, other large craft, and a sizable escort. Wish I could be more specific than that but this crew regularly rotates ships in and out of the squad. Would be smart to bring some support, so you don\u2019t get overwhelmed by their numbers.   \n\nComplete the job and we'll give the main contractor a bonus payment of <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) MG Scrip</EM4>.\n\nGood luck,\n\nEugene Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.","DescriptionKey":"Foxwell_ShipAmbush_H_desc_001","DisplayDescription":"Recently, a <EM4>[AmbushTarget]</EM4> baited Foxwell forces with a bogus rescue beacon. By the time our forces realized what was happening, a squad of ships unleashed a devastating attack and only one Foxwell contractor survived. Their scan logs identified the bait ship, and we\u2019ve had scouts monitoring them ever since.\n\nOur surveillance has revealed the squad has a regular flight pattern that we think we can exploit. There\u2019s a sizable emission cloud at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> that makes it an ideal spot to post up. Think you have what it takes to handle this for us? \n\nIt\u2019ll be you against the <EM4>[AmbushTarget]</EM4>, other large craft, and a sizable escort. Wish I could be more specific than that but this crew regularly rotates ships in and out of the squad. Would be smart to bring some support, so you don\u2019t get overwhelmed by their numbers.   \n\nComplete the job and we'll give the main contractor a bonus payment of <EM4>[ScripAmount] MG Scrip</EM4>.\n\nGood luck,\n\nEugene Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.","LocationPools":{"MissionLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Location","ResolvedLocations":[],"ResourceTags":[{"UUID":"6804b0a9-b01d-4c9a-8063-67784bd0f021","Name":"KillExclusive"}]}},"MissionTokens":[],"CalculatedReward":true,"TimeToComplete":15.7,"RewardItems":[{"AwardOnlyToMissionOwner":true,"Items":[{"Name":"MG Scrip","UUID":"0df18692-2cc7-4d9d-af85-95b8a7a45419","Amount":8,"SendToHome":true}]}],"Blueprints":[{"Chance":1,"PoolUUID":"af21edb5-3938-45ac-8a35-130e52463f44","PoolContents":[{"ItemName":"Parallax \"Sunstone\" Energy Assault Rifle","ItemUUID":"3e58c8fd-19ff-47b6-9b3a-333addb2573d","BlueprintUUID":"6157c081-0a9b-4319-bbbc-7f2cc1ef7158"},{"ItemName":"Antium Arms Jet","ItemUUID":"caa2922b-8512-4430-9980-6238747acaab","BlueprintUUID":"5dc3e1ce-22b9-4616-a4b6-5a7b18df07a9"},{"ItemName":"Antium Core Jet","ItemUUID":"7ffc92db-5f68-40a2-9709-227a